ARBAYEE&rsquo;N HAI ARBAYEE&rsquo;N SHABBIR KA HAI ARBAYEE&rsquo;N<br>
<br>
Arbayee&rsquo;n hai karbala mein Mustafa ki aal ka<br>
Qasim-e-Nausha ka Zainab ke donon laal ka<br>
Akber-e-Dilgeer ka Asghar se naune haal ka<br>
Jaa&rsquo;n nisar aane Shahe dilgeer ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Hai zameene karbala par moorde ranjo bala<br>
Raste mein Shahe deen ko dagh Muslim ka mila<br>
Seh gaya sadme pe sadme jaa&rsquo;n nisare kibriya<br>
Pyas ke sehra mein alam gir ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Hogaye jo naher pe Abbas ke shane juda<br>
Sar se sarki Zainab-o-Kulsoom ke usdam rida<br>
Thi Sakina ki fugha&rsquo;n maare gaye mere chacha<br>
Hyder-e-Karrar ki tasveer ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Teer se talwar se zaqmi tha Sarwar ka badan<br>
Chal rahi thi bhuke pyase ke gale par teghe zan<br>
Kat-ta tha bhaye ka sar thi samne bakas bahen<br>
Shor hai har su bapa Shabbir ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Dhal gaya ashoor ka din aagaye shame bala<br>
Sar se Aale Mustafa ke chin gaye hai hai rida<br>
Lut gaye Ahle Haram bimaar ka bistar jala<br>
Markaze tatheer ki tanveer ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Kaan se gohar Sakina ke utare shimr ne<br>
Aur tamache Binte Sarwar ko lagaya shimr ne<br>
Abid-e-Bimaar ko bedi pinaya shimr ne<br>
Noor-e-Aine Fatema dilgeer ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Rahe sham-o-kufa mein hoke rahe zulm-o-sitam<br>
Ooton se gir gir ke bache margaye har har qadam<br>
Saarba&rsquo;n bimaar tha aur berida Ahle Haram<br>
Lut gaya Hyder ka ghar Shabbir ka hai Arbayeen<br>
<br>
Baad marne ke Sakina ki rehaye mil gaye<br>
Behre chehlum Aale Ahmed jab suwe maqtal chali<br>
Dekh kar bhaye ka marqad kaanp uthi Binte Ali<br>
Peet sar Hyder Shahe dilgeer ka hai Arbayeen
